# Spyglass Siren: entering, it creates a Map token. Turn 3: the Map ({1}, {T}, sacrifice, at sorcery speed) makes the
# Siren explore (CR 701.44a): the revealed Forest is a land, so it goes to Bot1's hand and the Siren gets no counter.
# The Siren, a 1/1 flier, then attacks over Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which cannot block it (CR 702.9b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Spyglass Siren
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spyglass Siren.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Spyglass Siren; Map Token
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
