Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Map Token.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Spyglass Siren)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
? Bot1.Battlefield.Spyglass Siren.Power = 1
Bot1.Attack(Spyglass Siren > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Spyglass Siren)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

